# Bot2's Lingering Souls makes two Spirit tokens; Diabolic Edict has Bot2 choose one to sacrifice (CR 701.21a). A token that
# leaves the battlefield ceases to exist (CR 111.7), so it reaches no graveyard: Bot2's graveyard holds only Lingering Souls.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Diabolic Edict
Island x4
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Lingering Souls
Plains x4
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lingering Souls.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Diabolic Edict.Cast(Bot2)
Bot2.Choose(Spirit Token)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Lingering Souls
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 4
Bot1.Graveyard = Diabolic Edict
